Package: FAIRbioHeadersTools
Title: Native SHA-512/256 Checksums for FAIR-bioHeaders Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("FAIR-bioHeaders-Tools contributors", email = "molik@fhref.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes the FAIR-bioHeaders file checksum - SHA-512/256 over the
    exact bytes a file covers, per docs/FORMAT.md rules R1 to R4 - natively in R,
    from a vendored FIPS 180-4 implementation with no external library and no
    foreign-language runtime. Streams files of any size, excludes the checksum
    line from its own value, counts header lines outside the leading block, and
    refuses to load when its compiled core disagrees with the published sample
    digests. Header reading, contract validation and the shared conformance run
    build on this layer.
License: MPL-2.0 | file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: C99 (the vendored SHA-512/256 core in src/);
    a C compiler is required to build this package from source
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
